Subject: [PATCH 01248/11362] [conductor] In-process docs for ArcMemo v6:
 concept-LIBRARY learning (self-learning MANDATE; extends the exp4025 v5
 71->21-action transfer): v5 stored raw concepts; v6 COMPRESSES recurring
 induced-program fragments into NAMED, documented abstractions (LILO/Stitch,
 arXiv:2310.19791) that seed future induction. Measure whether the compressed
 library makes THIS milestone's new solves (exp4035 search-layer / exp4038 7th
 game) cheaper (fewer actions / fewer induction calls) than v5's raw memory
 and a cold start.

